#, no-c-format
msgid "Automatically installing a login driver"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:865
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Starting from version 1.16, &kdesrc-build; will try to install an "
"appropriate login driver, that will allow you to login to your &kdesrc-"
